    "text": "Lucy calls on Elinor, and in walks Edward. All three are {MISERABLE}. Lucy stays on {PURPOSE}, {SILENT} and watchful; Edward cannot {LOOK} at either of them; and only Marianne, who knows nothing, is {DELIGHTED}, and says so.",
